OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain across
OL,6,FOrkney will quickly move up into
OL,7,FShetland before clearing away north.
OL,8,FSome blustery showers will follow from
OL,9,Fthe southwest. Strong southerly winds
OL,10,Fwith gales developing overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FSome brightness at first,
OL,13,Fotherwise mainly cloudy with showers
OL,14,For longer spells of rain. Severe gale
OL,15,Fforce southwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
